{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1032_p", "source_sha256": "fb52b7b801a0b8a9a03b00bbc33cb101dedf46cc90a2708d881eb3515405c90e", "ja": "あ、もちろん覚えてる……ごめん。\nでも遅い時間になっちゃったし、どうするかな……。", "zh": "啊，我当然记得……对不起。\n不过时间也已经很晚了，该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1033_p", "source_sha256": "319a9fa898b5edeaf5840a12cb349a8557574fb1a11a55b8c3cd691060f272a3", "ja": "それに、美希も疲れてるだろ？\nデートはまた今度にして、今日は早めに寝た方が……。", "zh": "而且，美希也累了吧？\n约会还是改天再去，今天你还是早点睡比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "d8459ac53151ee60c61521793c65df8dee3363e3b499cbf587ced254fdbb976c", "ja": "や！　……だって、約束だもん。", "zh": "不要！……因为这是约定嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "9ff405de154d6c5c27f7b32f447cfca01acf8306bc7c7814d23e8965fba20094", "ja": "ハニー、ミキへのゴホウビに、デートしてくれるって。\nだからミキ、撮影も頑張ったんだよ？", "zh": "亲爱的，你说过要陪美希约会，作为给美希的奖励嘛。\n所以美希才努力拍摄的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "3aad5ae20e4f9f63e231f3491341dacecb9aa70b6c375d5c61af0d3d66db7ed6", "ja": "ハニーはミキとの約束、破っても……平気？", "zh": "亲爱的，就算你违背了和美希的约定……也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e2cc43c6cc8046ff6c4a3e3fc7e649cd3ffb844777fda26767a650b7c3ddaa7b", "ja": "平気じゃない……そうだよな。アイドルとの約束を\n破るようじゃ、プロデューサー失格だ。", "zh": "怎么可能不在乎……你说得对。要是连和偶像的\n约定都做不到，我就不配当制作人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1038_p", "source_sha256": "81bdcd504ceb24f6416d8870823b74ea92d4cdc576ea35d335779446f61834bf", "ja": "わかった。美希がまだ元気なら、付き合う……いや。\nよかったら、俺に付き合ってくれるかな？", "zh": "我明白了。要是美希还有精神，我就陪你……不对。\n如果你愿意，可以陪我一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1039_003mik", "source_sha256": "1b25152d24b0d025ad5c89a300da64040fec3f6e4dd1beb49416045d8b5f87ea", "ja": "ハニー……。うん！", "zh": "亲爱的……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1040_003mik", "source_sha256": "a710162ce239adca50f407dd8b35ba7fe04230a1e53a3083678776dfda7dd04f", "ja": "そうと決まったら、善は急げなのー！\nお店が閉まっちゃう前に、早く早く！", "zh": "既然决定了，就赶紧行动啦——！\n在店里关门前，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1041_p", "source_sha256": "866fc03b058250c9ef1b1a2f29505a3830476fd69ac2b8eee42d48256b002377", "ja": "わっ、わかった。わかったから引っ張らないで……\nせめて着替えさせてくれー！", "zh": "我、我知道了。我知道了，别拉我了……\n至少让我换身衣服啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "21f8d8cc4e7f56f51d763d8eab86c3bb61d445e9197d14135c889d0a68ede709", "ja": "あのいちごジェラート、おいしそう～！\nねぇねぇハニー、次はあそこに行きたいな♪", "zh": "那个草莓意式冰淇淋，看起来好好吃～！\n呐呐，亲爱的，下次我想去那里♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1043_p", "source_sha256": "853d0d9ad1a5deefb8b7ff13860b409490cf1ae4322cf00e1e24874b4dd7028c", "ja": "ま、待ってくれ美希……さっきマラサダを食べた\nばかりなのに、よくそんな走っていけるな？", "zh": "等、等等我啊美希……刚刚才吃了葡式甜甜圈，\n你怎么还能跑得这么起劲啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1044_003mik", "source_sha256": "713e894258c6d4b12616a8ec45f8cc23ef2489f2c87a7cf672bd3b4ca222341b", "ja": "だって、こんなにハニーをひとり占めできることって\nきっと、あんまりないから。", "zh": "因为，能像这样独占亲爱的机会，\n肯定不多嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1045_003mik", "source_sha256": "3468518461cc42320197590536823f11a25d36999d06264c78169f2381f28c3b", "ja": "いまのうちに、ぜんぶ楽しまないともったいないの！", "zh": "不趁现在好好享受个够的话，那就太可惜了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1046_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
