{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1048_p", "source_sha256": "73b6a02d6e5e32deb6e30390d948dcbb60755ddcbefee1948373f1b26a40e0c9", "ja": "あ、いや。なんでもないよ。\n……よし、行こうか！", "zh": "啊，不，没什么。\n……好了，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1049_003mik", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1050_p", "source_sha256": "dd57430b367bb7fcdc76b47b7b30a94b76d29960779a23294804e9cc3904cdd8", "ja": "（これ以上、ガッカリさせるわけにはいかない。\n残された時間で、できるだけ……）", "zh": "（不能再让她失望了。在剩下的时间里，尽可能地……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1051_003mik", "source_sha256": "fd9fb04734901840fa3c8c92ead7a28407fe97e9e37595e631a53397efcf5598", "ja": "ふ～。ハニー、今日はいっぱい付き合ってくれて、\nありがとうなの。", "zh": "呼～。亲爱的，谢谢你今天陪了我这么久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1052_003mik", "source_sha256": "f998d7b4a666d03f455c74c643bc9e3e92d9c999f9393d28a1022e27d918ee3c", "ja": "ミキ、デートの最後は、ここに来たかったんだ。", "zh": "美希想在约会的最后，来到这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1053_p", "source_sha256": "368a2e8a5ddfbb359aadd3221b949d6fc07767699e170eb991a3a47e694ff290", "ja": "ここは……昨日まで撮影で使っていた浜辺だよな？", "zh": "这里是……昨天之前还用于拍摄的海滩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1054_003mik", "source_sha256": "243f2909fc1ded1828697302a7295dea671059a38b334d82511c553f896c2d4f", "ja": "うん。お仕事のときはみんなも一緒だったから……\nハニーとふたりっきりで来たいな、って。", "zh": "嗯。工作的时候大家也都在一起，所以……想和亲爱的两个人单独来这里看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1055_003mik", "source_sha256": "310dac71c591f1ef2153124794b92cb82699afdffa8887141ff05b2db864397f", "ja": "でも、夜のほうがもっと素敵だったね！\n海がキラキラ輝いてて、ロマンチックなの……♪", "zh": "不过，晚上更棒呢！\n大海闪闪发光的，特别浪漫……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1056_p", "source_sha256": "d2a08e1bce856fe23bf82da55ffc3badeaf6963674030e44c1ec3a63e5665762", "ja": "美希。ご褒美の事だけど……\nその、何か他にできる事はないか？", "zh": "美希，关于奖励的事……那个，还有没有别的事情可以做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1057_003mik", "source_sha256": "002cf1452f69392492428c13e7e5b93b850a19d3873e3a3900795864051b438f", "ja": "？　どうして？", "zh": "为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1058_p", "source_sha256": "32e27b00e9027a1a01e0b69ab02568936ee18768976fdf90ac74b644aeb90829", "ja": "いや、楽しみにしてくれてたのに、結局、\n短い時間になっちゃったから……。", "zh": "不是，明明让你一直期待着，结果却只能待这么短的时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1059_003mik", "source_sha256": "5ad7898ae157773be9b2cd92fd56b91fb98607cede23f84d0e6d94ba0b972f01", "ja": "それって、ハニーがもっと……\nこの後も、ミキと一緒にいてくれるってコト？", "zh": "那就是说，亲爱的还会继续……之后也会陪着美希，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1060_p", "source_sha256": "72b0b278b33dae36e579f0cb43fe405759557a6d3ab0580378d188f9ba8013bb", "ja": "い、いや、もちろん、それ以外で……。", "zh": "不、不是，当然是除此之外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1061_003mik", "source_sha256": "3d9c0b80882df0e4698bde0b2c1cc8927aff482a757af233a985cb930cec481e", "ja": "……むー。だったら、いらないの。", "zh": "……唔。那样的话，我不要了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1062_p", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1063_003mik", "source_sha256": "d3d44319ef0094d3ab23a94826039fd40e913ec08642af070e942c9c65ca7665", "ja": "最近の{$P$}って、\nすっごく忙しいよね。", "zh": "最近的{$P$}，\n真的超级忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1064_003mik", "source_sha256": "aece3886a96cd7cf95deae1dc6f72f4809d53c4fb5dd0228b21c1344b3adabbf", "ja": "劇場の子たちのお仕事もどんどん増えてるから、\n当たり前って思うけど……。", "zh": "因为剧场里大家的工作也越来越多了，觉得这是理所当然的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1065_p", "source_sha256": "9bd418851c560cfe271ee6e017bf7e3b793a5f26c31adaf313d2c16bddaab392", "ja": "そうだな……。その分、美希や春香たち先輩のみんな\nには、付き添えてないことが多いと思う。", "zh": "是啊……相应地，我也经常没能陪在美希、春香她们这些前辈身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1066_p", "source_sha256": "e0d567aaab0fedecb60fa9ca3c00198a62d3edb8d212bd7d9fe8e3db809c44ef", "ja": "美希たちは、任せても大丈夫な部分があるから。", "zh": "美希她们有些事情，交给她们我也放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1067_003mik", "source_sha256": "cb1279f1f9cdedcbd3f0848bcc744034a32d898e6ea6cc3020c7a85c0e5469c4", "ja": "うん。でもミキは、{$P$}とふたりの\n時間が少なくなるのは、イヤだったの。", "zh": "嗯。不过，美希不想和{$P$}两个人相处的时间变少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1068_003mik", "source_sha256": "c4dcec8ea3b96d424c319b206059a6a2b26a8c5926559b48f2739836a6aa8bbf", "ja": "{$P$}が見てくれてないのに、\nお仕事はいっぱいだし……。", "zh": "明明{$P$}都没在看我，工作却一大堆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_134_1069_003mik", "source_sha256": "d092d7ba70af9418d9dd8ded6735c6c6dffb2d523e5921a25b4d8a15d82dfec5", "ja": "頑張るの、ヤダなって思う時もあったんだよ？", "zh": "也有过觉得不想努力的时候哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
